ass 2, battery / renewable energy powered\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN450-BAT-1\", \"label\": \"Reduced bore DN450, accuracy class 1, battery / renewable energy powered\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN450-BAT-2\", \"label\": \"Reduced bore DN450, accuracy class 2, battery / renewable energy powered\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN500-BAT-1\", \"label\": \"Reduced bore DN500, accuracy class 1, battery / renewable energy powered\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN500-BAT-2\", \"label\": \"Reduced bore DN500, accuracy class 2, battery / renewable energy powered\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN600-BAT-1\", \"label\": \"Reduced bore DN600, accuracy class 1, battery / renewable energy powered\"},\n      {\"model_id\": \"DN600-BAT-2\", \"label\": \"Reduced bore DN600, accuracy class 2, battery / renewable energy powered\"}\n    ]\n  },\n  \"components\": [...],\n  \"characteristics\": {\n    \"model_level\": [ five attribute entries ]\n  },\n  \"matrix_tables\": [ six entries ],\n  \"recommendation\": {\"id\": \"R49\", \"edition\": 2013, \"scheme\": \"A\", \"accuracy_classes\": [1, 2]},\n  \"footnotes\": [{\"marker\": \"[1]\", \"text\": \"The software version and checksum are displayed on the meter during the circular sequence every 10 minutes. The software version and checksum are displayed sequentially with first for the Measurement part then the Communications part.\"}]\n}\n\nI think this is complete. Write it out now, carefully, valid JSON.\n\nFor the matrix table column names for flow tables: \"q1\" might be ambiguous; use \"q1_minimum_flow_rate\"? I'll use [\"meter_size\", \"accuracy_class\", \"q1_minimum\", \"q2_transitional\", \"q3_permanent\", \"q4_overload\", \"q3_q1_ratio\"].\n\nFootnote text exact: \"The software version and checksum are displayed on the meter during the circular sequence every 10 minutes. The software version and checksum are displayed sequentially with first for the Measurement part then the Communications part.\" (keep original grammar \"with first for the Measurement part\").\n\nDescription of Table 5/6: \"The flow rates Q1, Q2, Q3 and Q4 can be freely chosen as long as: values Q3 and ratio Q3/Q1 are selected from paragraph 4.1 of OIML R49-1:2013; values mentioned for Q1 and Q2 are minimum values and the ratio Q2/Q1 = 1.6; values mentioned for Q3 and Q4 are maximum values and the ratio Q4/Q3 = 1.25; the ratio Q3/Q1 is at least 40.\"\n\nOK. Writing final answer now.",
